</jpcrp030000-asr_E01999-000:MetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01999-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationMetricsAndTargets contextRef="FilingDateInstant">統合報告書（29ページ）</jpcrp030000-asr_E01999-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationMetricsAndTargets>
